Sampāti approaches fasting monkeys eyeing long-awaited food --- Sampāti vows eating dead monkeys in succession --- Aṅgada sees Yama come under Sītā pretext --- Aṅgada laments failed Rāma mission and sudden calamity --- Aṅgada praises Jaṭāyu giving life for Vaidehī --- Aṅgada envies Jaṭāyu freed by Rāvaṇa battle death --- Aṅgada traces woes to Kaikēyī boon Rāma exile Vālin fall --- Sampāti trembles asking of dear brother Jaṭāyu battle death --- Sampāti seeks tale and begs descent from mountain
